# {{ slug }} — ONNX checkpoints

ONNX export of [`{{ source_model_id }}`](https://huggingface.co/{{ source_model_id }}) for
[OpenSTEF](https://github.com/OpenSTEF/openstef), produced by
[`foundation-model-checkpoints`](https://github.com/OpenSTEF/foundation-model-checkpoints).

OpenSTEF resolves these via `HubCheckpoint`; the metadata sidecar next to each weights file drives
the generic inference path. Each variant was gated by an accuracy-deviation check against the torch
reference on representative inputs before publishing.

